      "name": "GetFullName",
      "category": "PrimitiveSceneDesc",
      "signature": "GetFullName(Target)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "FPrimitiveSceneDesc*"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "String",
      "docs": "FPrimitiveSceneDesc is a structure that can be used to Add/Remove/Update primitives in an FScene.\nIt encapsulates all the necessary information to create/update the primitive. Usage of an PrimitiveComponentInterface\nis optional, but if one is not provided the ProxyDesc must already be created and passed in the ProxyDesc member."
